# skill-misplaced: a real folder in .claude/skills, or a link there to no skill
spec: Finders
args: agent-files skill-misplaced
-- .claude/skills/real/SKILL.md --
x
-- .claude/skills/dangling -> ../../.agents/skills/gone --
-- @stdout --
.claude/skills/dangling: links to ../../.agents/skills/gone, which isn't a skill in .agents/skills
.claude/skills/real/SKILL.md: a skill folder in .claude/skills; it belongs in .agents/skills
